        "fr-extract.jsonl": [
            {
                "entry_id": "314cab81-f896-31ba-8ab7-592f2545fd97",
                "word": "paradoxalement",
                "pos": "adv",
                "lang_code": "fr",
                "forms": [],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "32e380ad-43ee-3206-a73b-bec01e207725",
                        "entry_id": "314cab81-f896-31ba-8ab7-592f2545fd97",
                        "glosses": [
                            "D'une manière paradoxale, contradictoire, en forme de paradoxe."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "af8de493-6d94-4aa3-afc0-01164800a937",
                                "sense_id": "32e380ad-43ee-3206-a73b-bec01e207725",
                                "text": "Je comprends que, paradoxalement, pour qu'il n'y ait pas trop de vies détruites, il faut parfois tuer."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "d8357ad8-82f5-44ca-bc2c-bc94312cbd5f",
                                "sense_id": "32e380ad-43ee-3206-a73b-bec01e207725",
                                "text": "Les causes de l’absence de répression des atteintes aux religions traditionnelles africaines au Cameroun sont paradoxalement d’abord religieuses."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "ee3db281-127f-4b0b-a9df-d04b87c3929d",
                        "source_entry_id": "314cab81-f896-31ba-8ab7-592f2545fd97",
                        "source_sense_id": "32e380ad-43ee-3206-a73b-bec01e207725",
                        "target_lang_word": "paradoxerweise",
                        "target_lang_code": "de",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "paradoxerweise",
                                "target_lang_code": "de",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "0edb9c7c-f17c-39ea-a02d-0009c799b591",
                                        "entry_id": "1a4c60b4-eff6-3458-9ea1-492b7963e1f5",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "so, dass es paradox, widersprüchlich erscheint"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ee2c8985-0622-44a0-83c2-80e8fcc7e84b",
                                                "sense_id": "0edb9c7c-f17c-39ea-a02d-0009c799b591",
                                                "text": "Paradoxerweise könnte es durch die Klimaerwärmung in einigen Regionen auch kälter werden."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "3118bc36-858d-41ab-a0f3-0bd5da84a4cf",
                                                "sense_id": "0edb9c7c-f17c-39ea-a02d-0009c799b591",
                                                "text": "„\"Man kann hier solange studieren wie man will\", sagt Fachberater Blaseio. Paradoxerweise sind die einzigen, die von der Uni dazu gezwungen werden, schnell zu Ende zu studieren, die verbliebenen Diplom- und Magisterstudenten.“"
                                            }
                                        ],
                                        "sense_index_json": "\"1\""
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "0ad6e489-c60f-4c49-bd71-0cb23ef44baa",
                        "source_entry_id": "314cab81-f896-31ba-8ab7-592f2545fd97",
                        "source_sense_id": "32e380ad-43ee-3206-a73b-bec01e207725",
                        "target_lang_word": "paradoxically",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "paradoxically",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "87bc444a-7fcc-31a6-a9f9-26279adf76a8",
                                        "entry_id": "61c30fe1-b571-3c8a-ac76-a45b2b68669b",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "In a paradoxical manner; so as to create a paradox."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "557637e1-1591-4f95-ac6c-42c2cdbd4f36",
                                                "sense_id": "87bc444a-7fcc-31a6-a9f9-26279adf76a8",
                                                "text": "The proliferation of labor-saving devices has not given us more leisure time, paradoxically."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "130e8ad1-7b8c-4dd4-9cec-6a9a981e9a3c",
                                                "sense_id": "87bc444a-7fcc-31a6-a9f9-26279adf76a8",
                                                "text": "If there exists a non-empty set of uninteresting natural numbers, there must be a smallest uninteresting number, but this number is paradoxically interesting because it is the smallest uninteresting number."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "83792e02-eec0-4200-be50-febae3dcc149",
                                                "sense_id": "87bc444a-7fcc-31a6-a9f9-26279adf76a8",
                                                "text": "Paradoxically enough, however, in general only the parties of the Left have done most to spread the belief that it was the numerical strength of the opposing material interests which decided political issues, whereas in practice these same parties have regularly and successfully acted as if they understood the key position of the intellectuals."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "2d913ccc-57f1-477f-b9e2-b548e4917c27",
                                                "sense_id": "87bc444a-7fcc-31a6-a9f9-26279adf76a8",
                                                "text": "Paradoxically, the same faculty who complain about busyness are most likely to end up waiting passively. While they acquiescently wait to write, they busy themselves with other, often trivial, activities."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "015a849f-886b-453c-aa62-48b49790aa51",
                                                "sense_id": "87bc444a-7fcc-31a6-a9f9-26279adf76a8",
                                                "text": "But Central Point, which had been a visibly mixed-race community since the 19th century, was home to a secret but paradoxically open interracialism."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d08605db-9fa6-490f-b35e-b6d3f018a3e7",
                                                "sense_id": "87bc444a-7fcc-31a6-a9f9-26279adf76a8",
                                                "text": "Paradoxically, the deluge of writing itself contributes to declining readership. It's not just that if you're writing then you can't be reading. It's also that the sheer volume of what is now available acts as a disincentive to settle down with a single text. The literary equivalent of channel surfing replaces the prolonged concentration required to tackle a book."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "3b534d87-4094-4bec-a8ab-b5338be7c881",
                                                "sense_id": "87bc444a-7fcc-31a6-a9f9-26279adf76a8",
                                                "text": "Cottagecore is related to grandmacore, faeriecore, farmcore and goblincore; other nostalgia-ridden aesthetic communities that, paradoxically, thrive on many of the most popular internet platforms of the day."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "575a3e07-6440-49c2-9665-80866f4ef418",
                                                "sense_id": "87bc444a-7fcc-31a6-a9f9-26279adf76a8",
                                                "text": "Lacking the anthropomorphic elasticity of their hand-drawn counterparts in the original film, the animal characters of Favreau’s Lion King appeared, paradoxically, both lifelike and lifeless, their voices never matching their limited facial expressions"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "1767e30f-f0da-4621-bec6-7f4966262abb",
                        "source_entry_id": "314cab81-f896-31ba-8ab7-592f2545fd97",
                        "source_sense_id": "32e380ad-43ee-3206-a73b-bec01e207725",
                        "target_lang_word": "paradójicamente",
                        "target_lang_code": "es",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
